      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait really?? i was so sure it was just the stress. i don't have insurance right now so going to the er would be super expensive. is there any way i can just take some ibuprofen and rest it off for a night to see if the swelling goes down? i really cant afford a hospital visit right now.",
