      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear u but i'm honestly terrified of the bill. i'll just stay home and keep an eye on it for now. if the chest thing gets worse i'll call someone. if i just take a really strong dose of aspirin or something, would that help thin my blood enough to stop a clot from being an issue? like, would a higher dose of something i already have in my cabinet be a safe way to manage it until i can get to a doctor next week?",
